 "doc": "M4-C14-02 greybox (tools/act1/ch14_greybox.py; do not edit by hand): the Lacquer Court at dusk (colour script ch14). The court's floor under a red-lacquered colonnade, the wedding dais (vows: Sefir officiates), the guests' galleries, the Conclave's gallery (north-west), the water-steps down (a ramp; kerrid_steps: he holds them) to the bridal barge (barge_deck; the barge trigger runs the escape out across the water) and the water-gate beyond (merel_gate). Entered from the city at the east (CourtEntry). The story waits on the beat sheet (M4-C14-01).",
